#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:5 059e40be5e624c4ba527a6f2dbe1172a
msgid "Altitude Hold Mode"
msgstr "高度保持模式"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:7 a70d0036ede146408e716e1299563282
msgid ""
"In altitude hold mode, Copter maintains a consistent altitude while allowing"
" roll, pitch, and yaw to be controlled normally. This page contains "
"important information about using and tuning alt hold."
msgstr "在高度保持模式下，飞行器保持固定高度，同时允许正常控制横滚、俯仰和偏航。本页包含使用和调参AltHold的重要信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:12 d1fdf2fae16e48029342a6d1330101c9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:14 36ceb66f6bbb4f03875f5e3b6ffd267d
msgid ""
"When altitude hold mode (aka AltHold) is selected, the throttle is "
"automatically controlled to maintain the current altitude. Roll, Pitch and "
"yaw operate the same as in :ref:`Stabilize mode <stabilize-mode>` meaning "
"that the pilot directly controls the roll and pitch lean angles and the "
"heading."
msgstr ""
"当选择高度保持模式（即AltHold）时，油门将自动控制以维持当前高度。横滚、俯仰和偏航的操作方式与 :ref:`Stabilize模式 "
"<stabilize-mode>` 相同，即飞手直接控制横滚和俯仰倾斜角以及航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:20 071eebd792f54006b01e82766f8dadca
msgid ""
"Automatic altitude hold is a feature of many other flight modes "
"(:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`, :ref:`Sport <sport-mode>`, etc) so the "
"information here pertains to those modes as well."
msgstr ""
"自动高度保持是许多其他飞行模式（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`、:ref:`Sport <sport-mode>` "
"等）的特性，因此这里的信息同样适用于这些模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:27 7314b8750e9f4993b4ed9dbc7d78253e
msgid ""
"The autopilot uses a barometer which measures air pressure as the primary "
"means for determining altitude (\"Pressure Altitude\") and if the air "
"pressure is changing in your flight area due to extreme weather, the copter "
"will follow the air pressure change rather than actual altitude.  When "
"fitted and enabled, a downward facing rangefinder such as LiDAR or SONAR "
"will automatically provide even more accurate altitude maintenance, up to "
"the limit of the sensor."
msgstr ""
"飞控使用气压计测量气压作为确定高度（\"气压高度\"）的主要手段，如果您飞行区域的气压因极端天气而发生变化，飞行器将跟随气压变化而非实际高度。安装并启用向下测距仪（如激光雷达或声纳）后，将在传感器量程内自动提供更精确的高度保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:38 f2813b317aa94df4be462a1be77f7942
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:40 d912ccd4f57e456c969b1605cfdf1cd6
msgid ""
"The pilot can control the climb or descent rate of the vehicle with the "
"throttle stick."
msgstr "飞手可以通过油门摇杆控制飞行器的爬升或下降速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:43 ff420dcc806e43e79c403587b12aaece
msgid ""
"If the throttle stick is in the middle (40% ~ 60%) the vehicle will maintain"
" the current altitude."
msgstr "如果油门摇杆位于中间位置（40%~60%），飞行器将保持当前高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:45 82534ffa9742499e84218d632e8c7ca3
#, fuzzy, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Outside of the mid-throttle deadzone (i.e. below 40% or above 60%) the "
"vehicle will descend or climb depending upon the deflection of the stick.  "
"When the stick is completely down the copter will descend at 2.5m/s and if "
"at the very top it will climb by 2.5m/s.  These speeds can be adjusted with "
"the :ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` and :ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` "
"parameters. The acceleration used to establish these speeds is set by "
":ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>`."
msgstr ""
"在中间油门死区之外（即低于40%或高于60%），飞行器将根据摇杆偏转量下降或爬升。摇杆完全向下时飞行器以2.5m/s下降，完全向上时以2.5m/s爬升。这些速度可通过"
" :ref:`PILOT_SPEED_UP<PILOT_SPEED_UP>` 和 "
":ref:`PILOT_SPEED_DN<PILOT_SPEED_DN>` 参数调整。达到这些速度的加速度由 "
":ref:`PILOT_ACCEL_Z<PILOT_ACCEL_Z>` 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:50 47c04b60f4424fc287d610ac009c6ea7
msgid ""
"The size of the deadband can be adjusted with the :ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>` "
"parameter.  This param's value should be between \"0\" and \"400\" with "
"\"0\" meaning no deadband.  \"100\" would produce a deadband 10% above and "
"below mid throttle (i.e. deadband extends from 40% to 60% throttle stick "
"position)."
msgstr ""
"死区大小可通过 :ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>` "
"参数调整。该参数值应在\"0\"到\"400\"之间，\"0\"表示没有死区。\"100\"将在中间油门上下各产生10%的死区（即死区从40%到60%油门摇杆位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:55 83c093672a1140c395f1edda3812fc2e
msgid ""
"Copter allows arming and disarming in altitude hold mode. When disarming, "
"the copter may need to rest in the landing position for a few seconds to "
"allow the \"landing checker\" to verify that the copter has landed before "
"you are able to disarm."
msgstr "飞行器支持在高度保持模式下解锁和上锁。上锁时，飞行器可能需要在降落位置停留几秒，让\"降落检测器\"确认飞行器已着陆，之后才能上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:63 f284cdf4ebd54e3f9801d167384678cd
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:68 62d32bf06a464f569f1f12c3709c0200
msgid ""
"The Altitude Hold P is used to convert the altitude error (the difference "
"between the desired altitude and the actual altitude) to a desired climb or "
"descent rate.  A higher rate will make it more aggressively attempt to "
"maintain it’s altitude but if set too high leads to a jerky throttle "
"response."
msgstr ""
"高度保持P增益用于将高度误差（期望高度与实际高度的差）转换为期望爬升或下降速率。较高的值会使其更积极地保持高度，但设置过高会导致油门响应抖动。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:74 e42133ea7383435b8658ac09a9768c48
msgid ""
"The Throttle Rate (which normally requires no tuning) converts the desired "
"climb or descent rate into a desired acceleration up or down."
msgstr "油门速率（通常不需要调参）将期望的爬升或下降速率转换为期望的向上或向下加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:77 9d6b3a3d43b741f59d80cb35d7498152
msgid ""
"The Throttle Accel PID gains convert the acceleration error (i.e the "
"difference between the desired acceleration and the actual acceleration) "
"into a motor output.  The 1:2 ratio of P to I (i.e. I is twice the size of "
"P) should be maintained if you modify these parameters.  These values should"
" never be increased but for very powerful copters you may get better "
"response by reducing both by 50% (i.e P to 0.5, I to 1.0)."
msgstr ""
"油门加速度 PID 增益将加速度误差（即期望加速度与实际加速度之间的差值）转换为电机输出。如果您修改这些参数，应保持 P 与 I 的 1:2 比例（即 "
"I 是 P 的两倍）。这些值永远不应增加，但对于非常强劲的 Copter，您可以通过将两者都减少 50%（即 P 降至 0.5，I 降至 "
"1.0）来获得更好的响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:90 e86d54185a1b4880af564f39fd2dfaab
msgid "Verifying AltHold performance with dataflash logs"
msgstr "通过Dataflash日志验证AltHold性能"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:92 be974809db4044649ce56d20c8bc2fd6
msgid ""
"Viewing the altitude hold performance is best done by :ref:`downloading a "
"dataflash log <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` from your flight, then open it with the mission planner and graph "
"the barometer altitude, desired altitude and inertial navigation based "
"altitude estimate.  This data is found in slight different columns depending"
" upon the version and board."
msgstr ""
"查看高度保持性能最好的方法是 :ref:`下载飞行的Dataflash日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-"
"data-logs-in-mission-planner>`，然后用Mission "
"Planner打开并绘制气压计高度、期望高度和惯性导航高度估算的图表。具体数据在不同版本和板子的略有不同的列中。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:98 83e48cab907c42a0a56dc8eba926187d
msgid ""
"CTUN's BAlt (baroalt), DAlt (desired alt) and Alt (inertial nav alt "
"estimate)"
msgstr "CTUN的BAlt（气压高度）、DAlt（期望高度）和Alt（惯导高度估算）"

