#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:108 c4ced0a3fe8943a5a16bfccfa1e50576
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:110 d4b48f12febb4e34bc40162a04792046
msgid ""
"High vibrations can lead to the copter rapidly climbing as soon as altitude "
"hold is engaged.  Check the :ref:`Measuring Vibration <common-measuring-"
"vibration>` and :ref:`Vibration Dampening <common-vibration-damping>` wiki "
"pages for details on how to measure and reduce vibrations."
msgstr ""
"高震动会导致飞行器在高度保持模式一接合就迅速爬升。请查看 :ref:`测量震动 <common-measuring-vibration>` 和 "
":ref:`震动阻尼 <common-vibration-damping>` wiki页面，了解如何测量和减少震动。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:114 5dfdf656f46742d99ec6089b26eb3138
msgid ""
"Copter slowly descends or climbs until the pilot retakes control in "
"stabilize.  Normally this is caused by not having the throttle stick in the "
"mid position.  This commonly happens when the pilot is switching into "
"AltHold from a manual flight mode (like Stabilize) on a copter that does not"
" hover at mid throttle.  See the :ref:`wiki page related to setting the mid "
"throttle position <ac_throttlemid>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器缓慢下降或爬升，直到飞手在Stabilize模式下重新接管控制。通常这是由于油门摇杆不在中间位置造成的。这通常发生在飞手从手动飞行模式（如Stabilize）切换到AltHold时，而飞行器不在中间油门时悬停。请参见"
" :ref:`有关设置中间油门位置的wiki页面 <ac_throttlemid>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:119 b34cb65c60fb47e3842e149eaf929d73
msgid ""
"The motors seem to stop for a moment just as AltHold is engaged but then it "
"soon recovers.  This normally occurs when the pilot enters AltHold while "
"climbing rapidly.  The target altitude is set at the moment the pilot "
"switches into alt hold but because the vehicle is rising quickly it flies "
"above the target.  The aggressive altitude hold controller then responds by "
"momentarily reducing the motors to near minimum until the copter begins "
"falling back to the target altitude.  The workaround is to enter AltHold "
"while the copter is flying at a stable altitude."
msgstr ""
"AltHold接合时电机似乎短暂停止，但随即恢复。这通常发生在飞手在快速爬升时进入AltHold。切换到高度保持时的目标高度在那一刻设定，但由于飞行器上升很快，它飞过了目标高度。激进的高度保持控制器随即将电机暂时减至接近最低，直到飞行器开始回落到目标高度。解决方法是在飞行器平稳飞行时进入AltHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:128 bba067f1cb2f492195c1f3dab3c41b09
msgid ""
"Air pressure changes cause the vehicle to drift up or down by a couple of "
"meters over longer period of time or for the altitude shown on the GCS to be"
" inaccurate by a couple of meters including occasional negative altitudes "
"(meaning altitudes below the home altitude)."
msgstr "气压变化导致飞行器在较长时间内上下漂移几米，或 GCS 显示的高度不准确（包括偶尔的负高度，即低于 Home 高度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:133 8999cc35b5b54b9c89cf1a3f99c777ca
msgid ""
"Momentary altitude loss of 1m ~ 2m when the copter levels out after a high "
"speed forward flight.  This is caused by an aerodynamic effect which leads "
"to a momentary low pressure bubble forming on the top of the copter where "
"the autopilot is mounted which leads the altitude hold controller to believe"
" it is climbing so it responds by descending.  There is no cure for this "
"behaviour at the moment although increasing the ``EK2_ALT_M_NSE`` parameter "
"reduces the effect but increases the change of Common Problem #1 listed "
"above. The ``EK2_ALT_M_NSE`` parameter has a range from 0.1 to 10.0 and "
"allows increments of 0.1."
msgstr ""
"从高速前飞拉平后，飞行器短暂下降1m至2m。这是由于空气动力学效应，导致飞控安装处的飞行器顶部短暂形成低压区，使高度保持控制器误认为在爬升而做出下降响应。目前没有解决此问题的方法，但增大"
" ``EK2_ALT_M_NSE`` 参数可以减轻影响，但会增加上述常见问题#1的风险。 ``EK2_ALT_M_NSE`` "
"参数范围为0.1到10.0，步进量为0.1。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:143 4697129d007f4a278c06a0ac7ad65a01
msgid ""
"Altitude hold becomes erratic when the vehicle is close to the ground or "
"during landing.  This can be caused by the barometer being affected by "
"pressure changes created by prop-wash.  The solution is to move the "
"autopilot out of the prop wash effect or shield it within an appropriately "
"ventilated enclosure."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器接近地面或降落时高度保持变得不稳定。这可能是因为气压计受螺旋桨洗流引起的气压变化影响。解决方案是将飞控移出螺旋桨洗流影响区域，或在适当通风的外壳中屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:148 821bc09b5e374de5ab6eab2666ab6f08
msgid "Sudden altitude changes caused by light striking the barometer."
msgstr "光线照射气压计导致高度突变。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:152 71577fdc5d8c4685a907de0a769d7bee
msgid "Adequate Power"
msgstr "足够的动力"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:154 1c312fae3cbb464394e30f7ecba672f0
msgid ""
"It is very important that the vehicle has enough power available. Without "
"this the AltHold and attitude controllers can require more power than is "
"available from one or more motors and will be forced to sacrifice some "
"control which could lead to a loss of attitude or altitude."
msgstr ""
"飞行器拥有足够可用动力非常重要。否则AltHold和姿态控制器可能需要比一个或多个电机所能提供的更多动力，不得不牺牲部分控制，可能导致失去姿态或高度控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:160 13ab58bb159245bfb4198a201a4ca464
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Ideally the vehicle should be able to hover at about 50% throttle (mid "
"stick) and anything higher than 70% is dangerous."
msgstr "理想情况下，飞行器应能在大约50%油门（摇杆中位）处悬停，超过70%则存在危险。"

#: ../../source/docs/altholdmode.rst:165 24a11a4bb82942b2abf8b85acf0366e1
msgid ""
"If you incorporate expo on your transmitter, that directly increases the "
"size of the Alt Hold throttle dead band."
msgstr "如果在遥控器上设置了指数（expo），这会直接增大AltHold油门死区的大小。"
